            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{app=~\"$app\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Filtered on the app label. The scrape job for annotation-discovered pods is 'kubernetes-pods', not the app name, so filtering on job here would always be empty. Requests that never reach the app, because no pod is serving, are not here: read those from Responses by outcome (k6 client)."
    },
    {
